```bash
git clone {{REPO_URL}}.wiki.git
cd {{REPO_NAME}}.wiki
# edit, then:
git add . && git commit -m "Update docs" && git push origin master
```

`_Sidebar.md` controls the navigation on the left, and `_Footer.md` controls what shows up at the bottom of every page.

